{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Lord, bless Thy word [Bb7/Ab]to [Gm]every [Fm]heart
[Bb]In [Eb]this [Ddim]Thy house [Cm]today,
[Fm]And [Bb]help [Eb]us [Cm]each [Ab]as [Fm]now [Bb]we part,
[Ab/Eb]Its precepts to [Eb]obey.
[Ab]Amen
[Eb]Amen
{end_of_verse}
